WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.917 --> 00:00:01.918
LARRY DAVID:
It's a coffee place.

00:00:02.252 --> 00:00:03.795
I'm opening up a spite store
to take him out of business.

00:00:03.878 --> 00:00:06.214
I don't know what a spite store
is and I don't really care.

00:00:06.297 --> 00:00:07.340
♪ (UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:07.424 --> 00:00:09.008
Can I give you a little tip?

00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:10.593
If you're gonna
confront somebody,

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:12.387
better to do it with pants on.

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:13.388
The shorts...

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:16.057
It's hard to take a person
seriously wearing shorts.

00:00:16.141 --> 00:00:17.475
I wanna give you a heads up.

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:19.018
Susie's birthday's
in about a week.

00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:21.062
I already got her something.
It's gonna be a nice surprise.

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:22.105
What is it?

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:24.190
JEFF GARLIN:
 What were you thinking?

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:25.400
I'm done with presents!

00:00:25.483 --> 00:00:26.651
My birthday's coming up
in a month.

00:00:26.735 --> 00:00:28.111
-What are you getting me?!
-Nothing!

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:30.029
-Oh, thank you!
-You're welcome!

00:00:30.113 --> 00:00:30.905
(GROANS)

00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:32.991
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

